full-query: "You are re-architecting a legacy monolithic e-commerce application into a microservices-based architecture. The application uses a single Cloud SQL instance as its backend database. You want to make the database architecture more scalable and suitable for the microservices approach. Your goal is to minimize downtime while implementing changes and ensure that the application remains functional throughout the transition. What should you do?"
